sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Browser
    participant T as transfer-service
    participant TDB as transfer db
    participant K as Kafka
    participant R as risk-service
    participant A as account-service

    U->>T: POST /api/transfers (Idempotency-Key)
    T->>TDB: insert saga RUNNING, outbox EXECUTE RESERVE_LIMIT (one transaction)
    T-->>U: 202 view
    U->>T: GET /api/transfers/{id}/stream (SSE)
    T->>K: relay publishes saga.risk.commands
    K->>R: EXECUTE RESERVE_LIMIT
    R->>R: reserve limit, step_record APPLIED, outbox reply (one transaction)
    R->>K: relay publishes DONE on saga.transfer.replies
    K->>T: DONE RESERVE_LIMIT
    T->>TDB: step SUCCEEDED, outbox EXECUTE DEBIT_SOURCE
    T-->>U: SSE view
    Note over T,A: DEBIT_SOURCE and CREDIT_DESTINATION on account-service,<br/>CLEAR_TRANSFER on risk-service, same pattern
    K->>T: DONE CLEAR_TRANSFER
    T->>TDB: saga COMPLETED, deadline cleared
    T-->>U: SSE view COMPLETED, stream closes
